/ %!app.event% reads the running actor's events: the user binds two, and its list grows by both, the last bound last.
/ (A test run binds the test runner's own C# events on the same actor first, so the list starts with those.)
Start
- set %before% = %!app.event.list.count%
- before goal Process, call Log
- after goal Process, call Log
- set %events% = %!app.event.list%
- set %added% = %events.count% - %before%
- assert %added% equals 2, "the user's two events joined its list"
- assert %events.last.when% equals "after", "in the order bound: the after was bound last"

/ A goal the events are bound on.
Process
- set %done% = "yes"

/ The events' call.
Log
- set %logged% = "yes"
